# React Native Component Examples ({{ ui }})

Shared rules, whatever the library: exported props interface, optional `testID`,
accessibility labels/roles on interactive elements, translated text via `t()`, no
manual `React.memo` / `useCallback` (the React Compiler memoizes), `ref` as a normal
prop (React 19, no `forwardRef`). Styling follows `.claude/styles/{% if ui == 'StyleSheet' %}stylesheet{% elif ui == 'NativeWind' %}nativewind{% elif ui == 'Tamagui' %}tamagui{% else %}gluestack{% endif %}.md`.

